      "final_text": "美国宏观：7月核心消费者价格指数(CPI)环比+0.2%（市场预期+0.2%，前值持平）；年化核心通胀+2.5%（市场预期+2.5%，前值+2.6%）。整体消费者价格指数环比+0.1%（市场预期+0.1%，前值-0.4%）；年化整体通胀+3.4%（市场预期+3.4%，前值+3.5%）。月度整体涨幅中约三分之二归因于住房分项+0.1%的上涨，部分被能源-1.5%的下跌所抵消（延续6月5.7%的跌势）。核心商品环比+0.2%，此前6月为-0.1%；核心服务环比+0.2%，此前6月持平。",
      "iterations": 0,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. macro: July core CPI +0.2% m/m (vs consensus +0.2%, prior flat); annualized core +2.5% (vs consensus +2.5%, prior +2.6%). Headline CPI +0.1% m/m (vs consensus +0.1%, prior -0.4%); annualized headline +3.4% (vs consensus +3.4%, prior +3.5%). Roughly two-thirds of the monthly headline increase was attributed to the +0.1% rise in shelter, partially offset by a -1.5% decline in energy index (extending June's 5.7% decline). Core goods +0.2% following June's -0.1%; core services +0.2% following June's flat print.",
