      "final_text": "中国市场：中国股票走势分化（恒生指数-0.8%，沪深300指数+0.6%）。腾讯（700 HK）公布2026财年第二季度业绩，整体表现基本符合预期，营收同比增长+11%（高于预期1.0%），息税前利润(EBIT)同比增长+9%（与市场预期一致）。中国乘用车市场信息联席会 (CPCA) 数据显示，7月中国汽车出口量同比大幅跳升+88%至918万辆，国内生产车辆中有41%出口海外，而一年前这一比例仅为21%。与此形成对比的是，国内乘用车零售销量同比下滑-21%至1.46万辆，其中燃油车销量降幅达-41%。",
      "iterations": 1,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "China markets: Chinese equities were mixed (Hang Seng -0.8%, CSI 300 +0.6%). Tencent (700 HK) reported 2Q26 results that were mostly in line with revenue growing +11% YoY (1.0% above estimates) and EBIT growing +9% YoY (in-line with consensus). China Passenger Car Association (CPCA) data noted China's outbound shipments of cars jumped +88% y/y in July to 918k units, indicating 41% of vehicles manufactured in the country were sent overseas, compared with 21% a year ago. This is in contrast with the -21% y/y drop in domestic passenger vehicle retail sales to 1.46M units, led by a -41% decline in sales of internal combustion engine cars.",
